 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each sample is \"<time>:<f1->f2->...>\" with strictly increasing integer times; an empty stack is allowed. A frame instance at depth d continues from one sample to the next iff the stacks agree on positions 0..d (so recursion and re-entry are distinguished by position). As level 1, but only frame instances present in at least minSamples consecutive samples are reported (noise filter inferred).",
